<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Tommee Profitt</songwriter><songwriter>Mike Elizondo Jr</songwriter><songwriter>Nate Feuerstein</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body><div><p begin="0:00.686" end="0:05.110" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:00.686" end="0:05.110">I heard you told your friends that I'm just not your type</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我听说你告诉朋友说我根本不是你喜欢的类型</span></p><p begin="0:05.424" end="0:10.265" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:05.424" end="0:10.265">If that's how you really feel, then why'd you call last night?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果你真是这么想 那为什么昨晚还打电话给我</span></p><p begin="0:10.456" end="0:15.118" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:10.456" end="0:15.118">You say all I ever do is just control your life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说我所做的一切只是控制你的生活</span></p><p begin="0:15.315" end="0:17.707" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:15.315" end="0:17.707">But how you gonna lie like that?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但你怎么能这样撒谎</span></p><p begin="0:18.044" end="0:20.284" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:18.044" end="0:20.284">How you gonna lie like that?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你怎么能这样撒谎</span></p><p begin="0:20.905" end="0:23.898" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:20.905" end="0:23.898">Yeah, I heard you said I ain't the type for you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">耶 我听说你亲口说我不是你喜欢的类型</span></p><p begin="0:23.908" end="0:25.647" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:23.908" end="0:25.647">I don't regret it, though, I learned from it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我并不后悔 我从中吸取了教训</span></p><p begin="0:25.657" end="0:26.792" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:25.657" end="0:26.792">They should have you locked up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们真该把你关起来</span></p><p begin="0:26.802" end="0:29.029" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:26.802" end="0:29.029">For all the time you stole from us, wooh</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为你从我们这里偷走了那么多时光 喔</span></p><p begin="0:29.039" end="0:30.736" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:29.039" end="0:30.736">Took you out when I had no money</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我身无分文时也依旧带你出去</span></p><p begin="0:30.746" end="0:32.793" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:30.746" end="0:32.793">Only person that you ever cared about was you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你关心的只有你自己</span></p><p begin="0:32.803" end="0:33.814" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:32.803" end="0:33.814">That's why it's so funny</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这就是如此可笑的原因</span></p><p begin="0:33.936" end="0:35.936" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:33.936" end="0:35.936">You want somebody that'll keep you warm at night</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你想要一个能在夜晚给你温暖的人</span></p><p begin="0:35.946" end="0:37.637" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:35.946" end="0:37.637">Then tell me, "Why you acting cold to me?"</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那告诉我“为什么你对我如此冷漠”</span></p><p begin="0:37.806" end="0:39.038" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:37.806" end="0:39.038">You ain't the only one to blame</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你并不是唯一的过错方</span></p><p begin="0:39.048" end="0:40.278" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:39.048" end="0:40.278">Know I'm the one that made you rich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让你得寸进尺</span></p><p begin="0:40.288" end="0:42.246" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:40.288" end="0:42.246">When I bought every lie you sold to me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">耶 听说你丢掉了我们的照片</span></p><p begin="0:42.351" end="0:44.109" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:42.351" end="0:44.109">Yeah, heard you threw away the pictures</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但你依然拥有我们的回忆</span></p><p begin="0:44.344" end="0:46.026" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:44.344" end="0:46.026">But you still got the memories of us</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我想这其实没什么区别</span></p><p begin="0:46.036" end="0:47.918" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:46.036" end="0:47.918">So I guess I don't really make a difference</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你在脑海中翻看这些回忆</span></p><p begin="0:47.928" end="0:49.290" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:47.928" end="0:49.290">Flipping through 'em in your head</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让你在深夜忍不住给我发消息</span></p><p begin="0:49.300" end="0:51.179" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:49.300" end="0:51.179">Got you texting me all hours of the night</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">耶 你告诉我你需要距离</span></p><p begin="0:51.189" end="0:52.926" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:51.189" end="0:52.926">Yeah, you told me that you needed distance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你到底想怎样</span></p><p begin="0:53.037" end="0:54.019" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:53.037" end="0:54.019">What's the deal with you?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说你想要一个真诚的男人</span></p><p begin="0:54.574" end="0:56.039" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:54.574" end="0:56.039">You say you want a man that keeps it real</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那我对你真诚时 为什么你会生气</span></p><p begin="0:56.049" end="0:58.033" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:56.049" end="0:58.033">Then why you mad when I get real with you?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你想要有人为你支付账单</span></p><p begin="0:58.043" end="0:59.636" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:58.043" end="0:59.636">You want someone to pay the bills for you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经那么在乎你 现在我为你感到可悲 骗子</span></p><p begin="0:59.646" end="1:02.063" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:59.646" end="1:02.063">Went from feeling you, now I feel for you, liar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我听说你告诉朋友说我根本不是你喜欢的类型</span></p><p begin="1:01.356" end="1:05.698" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.356" end="1:05.698">I heard you told your friends that I'm just not your type</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果你真是这么想 那为什么昨晚还打电话给我</span></p><p begin="1:05.982" end="1:10.813" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.982" end="1:10.813">If that's how you really feel, then why'd you call last night?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说我所做的一切只是控制你的生活</span></p><p begin="1:10.997" end="1:15.785" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.997" end="1:15.785">You say all I ever do is just control your life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但你怎么能这样撒谎</span></p><p begin="1:15.948" end="1:18.310" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.948" end="1:18.310">But how you gonna lie like that</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你怎么能这样撒谎</span></p><p begin="1:18.725" end="1:20.925" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.725" end="1:20.925">How you gonna lie like that?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看 让我猜猜 你想要继续做朋友</span></p><p begin="1:22.146" end="1:24.439" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.146" end="1:24.439">Look, let me guess, you want to stay friends?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还告诉别人我们一直是这样吗</span></p><p begin="1:24.608" end="1:26.200" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.608" end="1:26.200">Telling people that's how we been?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉所有人 耶 我们几乎都不怎么说话了</span></p><p begin="1:26.210" end="1:28.757" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.210" end="1:28.757">Telling everybody, yeah that we was barely speaking</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嗯 真可笑 那你为什么每天都给我打电话</span></p><p begin="1:28.767" end="1:31.439" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.767" end="1:31.439">Huh, that's kinda funny, why'd you call me every day then?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是不成熟的表现 你太离谱了</span></p><p begin="1:31.449" end="1:33.868" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.449" end="1:33.868">That's immaturity, you going off the deep end</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你只是想找一个可以一起放松 喝点东西的人</span></p><p begin="1:33.878" end="1:36.461" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.878" end="1:36.461">You just want somebody you can chill and get some drinks with</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就别在周末联系我</span></p><p begin="1:36.471" end="1:37.187" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:36.471" end="1:37.187">Cool</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 你怀念我们曾经的交谈方式和我倾听的样子 耶</span></p><p begin="1:37.314" end="1:38.882" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.314" end="1:38.882">Then don't hit me on the weekend</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你为什么玩弄我的感情 嗯</span></p><p begin="1:38.892" end="1:42.196" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.892" end="1:42.196">Telling me you missed the way we talked and how I listen, yeah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你为什么浪费我的时间 嗯</span></p><p begin="1:42.974" end="1:44.843" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.974" end="1:44.843">Why you playing with my mind, huh?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你曾告诉我 我们应该放手 把一切抛到脑后</span></p><p begin="1:44.874" end="1:46.427" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.874" end="1:46.427">Why you playing with my time, huh?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我照做了 现在你却问我做了什么</span></p><p begin="1:46.437" end="1:49.134" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.437" end="1:49.134">Told me we should let it go and put it all behind us</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我觉得你只是喜欢被关注 还试图把所有烦心事倒给我听</span></p><p begin="1:49.144" end="1:51.441" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:49.144" end="1:51.441">That's what I did, now you asking me what I done</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也有自己的烦恼 我可没时间来应付这些破事儿</span></p><p begin="1:51.451" end="1:54.298" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:51.451" end="1:54.298">I was waiting for this day, I saw it coming</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你告诉我 你真的不想说话</span></p><p begin="1:54.308" end="1:56.809" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.308" end="1:56.809">I think you just like attention, tryna tell me all your problems</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那你为什么还给我打电话 嗯</span></p><p begin="1:56.819" end="1:59.313" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.819" end="1:59.313">I got issues of my own, I ain't got time for all this drama</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我听说你告诉朋友说我根本不是你喜欢的类型</span></p><p begin="1:59.323" end="2:01.147" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.323" end="2:01.147">You told me that you don't really wanna talk</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果你真是这么想 那为什么昨晚还打电话给我</span></p><p begin="2:01.157" end="2:02.399" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.157" end="2:02.399">Then why you calling, huh?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说我所做的一切只是控制你的生活</span></p><p begin="2:01.952" end="2:06.305" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.952" end="2:06.305">I heard you told your friends that I'm just not your type</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但你怎么能这样撒谎</span></p><p begin="2:06.555" end="2:11.419" itunes:key="L53" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:06.555" end="2:11.419">If that's how you really feel, then why'd you call last night?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你怎么能这样撒谎</span></p><p begin="2:11.747" end="2:16.466" itunes:key="L54" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:11.747" end="2:16.466">You say all I ever do is just control your life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你怎么能撒谎</span></p><p begin="2:16.646" end="2:18.980" itunes:key="L55" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:16.646" end="2:18.980">But how you gonna lie like that</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你怎么能这样撒谎</span></p><p begin="2:19.316" end="2:21.522" itunes:key="L56" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:19.316" end="2:21.522">How you gonna lie like that?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 你怎么能撒谎</span></p><p begin="2:23.703" end="2:25.015" itunes:key="L57" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:23.703" end="2:25.015">How you gonna lie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你怎么能这样撒谎</span></p><p begin="2:25.569" end="2:27.641" itunes:key="L58" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:25.569" end="2:27.641">How you gonna lie like that?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你怎么能撒谎</span></p><p begin="2:28.449" end="2:30.063" itunes:key="L59" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:28.449" end="2:30.063">Baby, how you gonna lie?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 你怎么能这样撒谎</span></p><p begin="2:30.576" end="2:32.689" itunes:key="L60" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:30.576" end="2:32.689">How you gonna lie like that?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不 不</span></p><p begin="2:33.130" end="2:34.552" itunes:key="L61" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:33.130" end="2:34.552">How you gonna lie?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我听说你告诉朋友说我根本不是你喜欢的类型</span></p><p begin="2:35.135" end="2:37.838" itunes:key="L62" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:35.135" end="2:37.838">Baby, how you gonna lie like that?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">（宝贝 你怎么能这样撒谎）</span></p><p begin="2:39.205" end="2:40.422" itunes:key="L63" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:39.205" end="2:40.422">No, no</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果你真是这么想 那为什么昨晚还打电话给我</span></p><p begin="2:41.148" end="2:43.348" itunes:key="L64" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:41.148" end="2:43.348">How you gonna lie like that?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">（告诉我 你怎么能这样撒谎）</span></p><p begin="2:42.469" end="2:46.915" itunes:key="L65" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:42.469" end="2:46.915">I heard you told your friends that I'm just not your type</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说我所做的一切只是控制你的生活</span></p><p begin="2:46.181" end="2:48.311" itunes:key="L66" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:46.181" end="2:48.311">(Baby, how you gonna lie like that?)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但你怎么能这样撒谎</span></p><p begin="2:47.024" end="2:51.720" itunes:key="L67" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:47.024" end="2:51.720">If that's how you really feel, then why'd you call last night?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 你怎么能这样撒谎</span></p><p begin="2:51.116" end="2:54.019" itunes:key="L68" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:51.116" end="2:54.019">(Tell me, how you 'bout to lie like that?)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 你怎么能这样撒谎</span></p><p begin="2:52.117" end="2:56.948" itunes:key="L69" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:52.117" end="2:56.948">You say all I ever do is just control your life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是我轻信了你“卖”给我的每一个谎言</span></p><p begin="2:56.958" end="2:59.477" itunes:key="L70" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:56.958" end="2:59.477">But how you gonna lie like that</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好吧</span></p><p begin="2:59.487" end="3:01.765" itunes:key="L71" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:59.487" end="3:01.765">How you gonna lie like that?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直在等这一天 我早就预料到了</span></p><p begin="3:06.301" end="3:08.727" itunes:key="L72" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:06.301" end="3:08.727">Tell me, how you 'bout to lie like that?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你怎么能这样撒谎</span></p><p begin="3:11.365" end="3:13.088" itunes:key="L73" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:11.365" end="3:13.088">Tell me, how you 'bout to lie like</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你怎么能这样撒谎</span></p></div></body></tt>